  {
   "sheet": "B2C Channel",
   "owners": "Aniket (D2C), Liza (MP)",
   "text": "Table-01> We need orders and items quantities as well, so that U2S can be monitored and capacity can be planned accordingly"
  },
  {
   "sheet": "B2C Channel",
   "owners": "Aniket (D2C), Liza (MP)",
   "text": "Table-02> We need Sales events dates and % BAU per day Increase volume details, so that same capacity can be planned accordingly and monitor closely to avoid any breaches and cost impact."
  },
  {
   "sheet": "B2B MP Channel",
   "owners": "Liza",
   "text": "Table-03> We need B2B MP Monthly Volumes, so that same capacity can be planned accordingly and monitor closely to avoid any breaches and cost impact."
  },
  {
   "sheet": "B2B Retail Store",
   "owners": "Medha and Devender",
   "text": "Table-04> We need Weekly numbers for Number of NSO Launch, Inventory requirement for NSO, weekly replinishmnet requirement for existing stores as well, so that same capacity can be planned accordingly and monitor closely to avoid any breaches and cost impact."
  },
  {
   "sheet": "Category Projections",
   "owners": "Niketh",
   "text": "Table-05> We need category wise and WH Wise break-up to plan Ramp-up and Ram-down for both warehouse, so that same can be monitored and capacity can be planned accordingly for peak season"
  },
  {
   "sheet": "Assumptions",
   "owners": "All",
   "text": "1. Going forward we will be considering this particular data for WH capacity planning and Ramp-up+Ramp-Down for both Gurgaon and Bangalore respectively, to avoid any disruption for over/under utilization of both warehouse and avoid any extra cost impact."
  },
  {
   "sheet": "General Guidelines",
   "owners": "All",
   "text": "1. All upcoming month data should be filled by Week-03 of previous month, for example Aug-25 data should be filled up by closing of 21-Jul-25 2. Considering Aug-25 being first time we are initiating this S&OP Projection, hence would need all teams help to complete same by 4-Aug-25 EOD, as upcoming months are very critical from sales and expansion POV. 3. We will schedule follow-up call next week to help to understand sheet for filling this data. 4. NSO numbers has to communicated 2 months in prior"
  }
